                        (1) Introduction & features
         <---------------------------------------------------------->

  1-1 - General information
  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

  DayDream BBS was originally developed for the IBM PC and it was some
  kind of QuickBBS clone. It was programmed by Tuomas Tonteri, but
  when A1200 was released Tuomas sold his PC and bought an Amiga. He started
  to code a new AmiExpress-lookalike BBS-program, but the name was the same,
  DayDream BBS. At the beginning, DayDream evolved pretty rapidly, but
  after one year of programming Tuomas ran out of time and the studying
  and a girlfriend took all his time, so he gave the sources etc to me.
  Soon Tuomas changed back to the PC, but still DayDream is evolving
  at the full speed. 


